{"product":{"id":9692815294770,"title":"Single Origin","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eOur single origin is a seasonal roast. We approach this as an omniroast, going flexibility in brewing. Centred around a a medium roast profile as an espresso, but being able to be enjoyed as a plunger, stove top and batch brew.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eOrigin: Brazil\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eFarm: Sucuri\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eProcess method: Natural\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eVarietal: Yellow Catuai\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eTasting notes: Rose, apricot, ripe fruit, floral, milk chocolate finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eBrew: Stovetop, espresso, French press\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eRecommended Recipe: \u003cu\u003eEspresso\u003c\/u\u003e: 1:1.85 grams-in-to-grams-out over 30 seconds. If it tastes sour, run the shot for longer. If washed out or bitter shorten then shot until you find a flavour profile you enjoy\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Hark Coffee","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-11-08T18:20:26+10:30","handle":"single-origin-coffee","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:39+09:30","published_at":"2024-11-08T18:20:26+10:30","template_suffix":"single-origin","published_scope":"global","tags":"build-box, coffee, espresso, french press, medium, plunger, single origin, stove top","variants":[{"id":49856847380786,"product_id":9692815294770,"title":"400g \/ Whole Beans","price":"41.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"400g","option2":"Whole Beans","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-03-21T09:35:14+10:30","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:39+09:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":50221768606002,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"AUD","compare_at_pr